sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Host as Host / future app
    participant Boot as One-shot<br/>bootstrap
    participant Data as Private user<br/>volume
    participant Web as AnkiWeb
    participant Anki as Normal Anki service
    User->>Host: Connect account credentials
    Host->>Boot: Read-only secret mount, download policy
    Boot->>Data: Lock volume and check account binding
    alt Account or profile mismatch
        Boot-->>Host: Sanitized error, no remote login
    else Matching account / fresh volume
        Boot->>Web: Collection.sync_login(email, password)
        Web-->>Boot: Authentication key
        Boot->>Data: Save key in profile
        opt Fresh, not-yet-served collection
            Boot->>Web: Negotiate sync, download collection
            Web-->>Boot: Existing collection
            Boot->>Data: Save initialized state, ensure POC deck
        end
        Boot-->>Host: ready, close collection and exit
        Host->>Host: Remove temporary credential file
        Host->>Anki: Start without password mount
        Anki->>Data: Read saved key and collection
        Note over Anki,Data: Restart and recreation reuse this volume
    end
